 "Events · {n}": "事件 · {n}",
 "Every event carries a provenance: {canonical}, {visual}, {inferred}, {reconstructed} or {unresolved}. Movement between known points may be interpolated, and is labelled. Nothing is invented as canon.": "每个事件都标有出处类别：{canonical}、{visual}、{inferred}、{reconstructed} 或 {unresolved}。已知地点之间的移动可能经过插值，并会注明，绝不把编造的内容当作原作。",
 "Every figure is summed from event-level records. See the dossiers for sources.": "所有数字均由事件级记录汇总而来，出处见各档案。",
 "Every tick is an event, the coloured bands are the stages of the war. Click anywhere to jump there, or drag to scrub. Rewinding shows exactly what happened, nothing is lost.": "每个刻度都是一个事件，彩色色带是战争的各个阶段。点击任意位置就能跳过去，拖动可以来回快进快退。倒回去看到的就是当时发生的一切，什么都不会丢。",
 "Everything on the map comes with its source, and anything reconstructed says so. Have fun exploring.": "地图上的所有内容都标了出处，推测还原的部分也会注明。尽情探索吧！",
