 "Gradient": "渐变",
 "Ground taken and lost as the armies move: it stays held until retaken, cut off or returned, and the front moves with the clock. RECONSTRUCTED from recorded positions and strengths (the novels draw no front line). Campaign-wide, so force filters do not change it.": "随军队移动而夺取和失去的地区：在被夺回、切断或归还前一直保持，战线随时间推移。由记录的位置和兵力复原（小说中并未画出战线），作用于整个战役，因此部队筛选不会改变它。",
 "Ground taken around the armies. It stays taken after they move on, until it is retaken, cut off or returned at the end of hostilities.": "军队周边夺取的地区。军队离开后仍然保持，直到被夺回、被切断，或在敌对行动结束时归还。",
