 "History on the record": "记录中的历史",
 "Hit this (or Space) and the war starts moving. Armies march, fronts shift, numbers roll. Press it again to pause anywhere.": "点这里（或按 Space），战争就动起来了。军队行进，战线推移，数字滚动。再点一下，随时都能暂停。",
 "Hostilities ended": "敌对行动结束",
 "I hope the Tensura production team gets to see this project of mine someday.": "希望有一天，转生史莱姆的制作团队能看到我的这个作品。",
 "I love the Tempest–Eastern Empire war arc, so I read volumes 12 to 16 again with a notebook open and turned the war into a map you can play like a documentary. Every movement, battle and loss is placed from the novels. Where the books are silent, the map says so.": "我非常喜欢 Tempest–Eastern Empire 战争篇，所以翻开笔记本，把第 12 到 16 卷重读了一遍，把这场战争做成了一张可以像纪录片一样播放的地图。每一次行军、每一场战斗、每一次损失都依据小说来摆放，书里没写的地方，地图上也会如实说明。",
