 "That’s it, enjoy the war!": "就这些啦，好好享受这场战争吧！",
 "The armies": "各路大军",
 "The atlas renders with WebGL. Enable hardware acceleration, or open it in a browser that supports WebGL 2.": "本图集使用 WebGL 渲染。请启用硬件加速，或使用支持 WebGL 2 的浏览器打开。",
 "The campaign atlas lives at the root of this site.": "战役图集位于本站首页。",
 "The campaign dataset did not load": "战役数据集未能加载",
 "The campaign in stages. Pick one to move there. Play to watch it unfold on the map.": "分阶段呈现的战役。选择一个阶段即可跳转，播放即可在地图上观看其展开。",
 "The capital of a nation, inside its outline.": "一国的首都，位于其轮廓内。",
 "The clean Base Map for following the war, or the painted Myth Map for the world itself. Switching keeps your place in time.": "想跟着战局走就用简洁的 Base Map，想看看这个世界就用手绘风的 Myth Map。切换时时间位置不变。",
 "The drawn area is schematic: the supplied maps show no theatre boundaries. It is clipped to the traced national borders so it never crosses into the sea or a neighbouring state.": "所绘范围仅为示意：提供的地图上没有战区边界。范围已按描出的国界裁切，因此不会越入海洋或邻国。",
 "The edge of held ground. It moves with the clock, forwards and backwards.": "控制区的边缘，随时间前后移动。",
 "The event is canonical. Its exact position, path or timing on this map is reconstructed.": "事件本身来自原作，它在本地图上的确切位置、路径或时间为复原。",
 "The evidence is insufficient. Shown so the gap stays visible.": "证据不足。予以显示，以便让空白保持可见。",
 "The five covers of this war’s volumes, made into wallpapers, plus two moments from the map. Tap to save.": "本场战争五卷的封面制成的壁纸，另有两幅来自地图的画面。点按即可保存。",
 "The map could not start": "地图无法启动",
 "The map could not start.": "地图无法启动。",
 "The map is a fictional world. Borders are traced from the supplied Base Map. Positions are simulation coordinates, never latitude and longitude. Unknown numbers stay unknown and are never shown as zero.": "这张地图描绘的是虚构世界。边界描自提供的 Base Map，位置是模拟坐标，而非经纬度。未知的数字保持未知，绝不显示为零。",
 "The novels give no clock times or calendar dates. Battle days (D−, D+) count from first contact. Every HH:MM is a simulation placement on a 10-minute grid, and the “year 9001” calendar is an artificial marker.": "小说中没有给出具体时刻或日历日期。战斗日（D−、D+）从首次接触起算，所有 HH:MM 都是 10 分钟网格上的模拟设定，“9001 年”历法只是人为标记。",
 "The number is stated by the source.": "该数字由资料明确给出。",
 "The painted world map, for geographic and lore context.": "手绘世界地图，用于了解地理和世界观。",
 "The pale strip is ground about to change hands. The winner's colour follows it in from the front.": "浅色带是即将易手的地区，胜方的颜色从战线一侧渗入。",
 "The runtime dataset is generated at build time. Run the compile and validate steps, then reload.": "运行时数据集在构建时生成。请执行编译和校验步骤，然后重新加载。",
 "The Situation panel tells you who is up against whom, how many have fallen and what just happened. Click any name to open its full file.": "态势面板会告诉你谁在和谁对阵、倒下了多少人、刚刚发生了什么。点击任意名字即可打开完整档案。",
 "The span is derived from the events assigned to the battle. The source gives no start or end time.": "时间跨度根据分配给该战斗的事件推算，资料未给出开始或结束时间。",
 "The strength at departure is not assumed to hold during the march. Intermediate strength is unknown unless recorded.": "不假定出发时的兵力在行军途中保持不变，除非有记录，途中兵力不明。",
 "The timeline": "时间轴",
 "The war of volumes 12 to 16": "第12至16卷的战争",
 "Theatre": "战区",
